1:["$","main",null,{"className":"reading-page post-reading-page","children":["$","article",null,{"className":"post-article h-entry","children":[["$","$L7",null,{"className":"u-url sr-only","href":"/blog/fosa/fosa-ch12","children":["FOSA丨12丨微核架构"," 永久链接"]}],["$","a",null,{"className":"p-author h-card sr-only","href":"https://github.com/hedon954","rel":"author","children":"Hedon"}],"$undefined",["$","header",null,{"className":"article-header article-summary-row","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"eyebrow","children":"架构设计"}],["$","h1",null,{"className":"p-name","children":"FOSA丨12丨微核架构"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"article-deck p-summary","children":"本篇通过回答《Fundamentals of Software Architecture》第十二章的课后思考题，深入探讨微核架构中插件组件间依赖关系的设计原则、插件管理工具与框架的选择策略、第三方插件契约兼容性处理方案，以及微核架构的分区特性、架构量子特征和领域同构性概念分析，帮助理解微核架构的核心设计模式和扩展机制，提升架构师在构建可扩展系统时的架构选择能力和插件化设计水平。"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"article-meta","children":[["$","time",null,{"className":"dt-published","dateTime":"2025-07-16T10:20:00.000Z","children":["发布于 ","2025/07/16"]}],"$undefined",["$","span",null,{"children":"$undefined"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["约 ","2,095"," 字"]}]]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"article-reading-layout","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"article-reading-column","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"e-content","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"markdown-body","children":[["$","p","p-0",{"children":["本系列文章通过逐章回答",["$","a","a-0",{"href":"https://fundamentalsofsoftwarearchitecture.com/","node":{"type":"element","tagName":"a","properties":{"href":"https://fundamentalsofsoftwarearchitecture.com/"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"《Fundamentals of Software Architecture》","position":{"start":{"line":1,"column":13,"offset":12},"end":{"line":1,"column":52,"offset":51}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":1,"column":12,"offset":11},"end":{"line":1,"column":102,"offset":101}}},"target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer","children":"《Fundamentals of Software Architecture》"}],"（下文简称 FOSA）一书中的课后思考题，来深入理解书中的核心概念和理论，从而提升我们的软件架构设计能力。本篇为",["$","u","u-0",{"children":"第十二章"}],"内容。"]}],"\n",["$","p","p-1",{"children":"本章的课后题是："}],"\n",["$","ol","ol-0",{"children":["\n",["$","li","li-0",{"children":["\n",["$","p","p-0",{"children":"What is another name for the microkernel architecture style?"}],"\n",["$","p","p-1",{"children":"微核架构风格的别名是什么？"}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-1",{"children":["\n",["$","p","p-0",{"children":"Under what situations is it OK for plug-in components to be dependent on other plug-in components?"}],"\n",["$","p","p-1",{"children":"在什么情况下，插件组件之间可以相互依赖？"}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-2",{"children":["\n",["$","p","p-0",{"children":"What are some of the tools and frameworks that can be used to manage plug-ins?"}],"\n",["$","p","p-1",{"children":"有哪些工具和框架可用于管理插件？"}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-3",{"children":["\n",["$","p","p-0",{"children":"What would you do if you had a third-party plug-in that didn’t conform to the standard plug-in contract in the core system?"}],"\n",["$","p","p-1",{"children":"如果一个第三方插件不遵循核心系统的标准插件契约，你会怎么做？"}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-4",{"children":["\n",["$","p","p-0",{"children":"Provide two examples of the microkernel architecture style."}],"\n",["$","p","p-1",{"children":"举 2 个微核架构的例子。"}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-5",{"children":["\n",["$","p","p-0",{"children":"Is the microkernel architecture style technically partitioned or domain partitioned?"}],"\n",["$","p","p-1",{"children":"微核架构是技术分区还是领域分区？"}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-6",{"children":["\n",["$","p","p-0",{"children":"Why is the microkernel architecture always a single architecture quantum?"}],"\n",["$","p","p-1",{"children":"为什么微核架构总是单一的架构量子？"}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-7",{"children":["\n",["$","p","p-0",{"children":"What is domain/architecture isomorphism?"}],"\n",["$","p","p-1",{"children":"什么是领域/架构同构性？"}],"\n"]}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","hr","hr-0",{}],"\n",["$","h2","h2-0",{"id":"拓扑","children":["$","a","a-0",{"href":"#拓扑","node":{"type":"element","tagName":"a","properties":{"href":"#拓扑"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"拓扑","position":{"start":{"line":39,"column":4,"offset":1023},"end":{"line":39,"column":6,"offset":1025}}}]},"children":"拓扑"}]}],"\n",["$","p","p-2",{"children":["微核架构，也被称为",["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"插件化架构（Plug-in Architecture）"}],"，是一种能够提供极高扩展性、灵活性和演化能力的系统设计模式。它的核心思想是将系统功能划分为两部分：一个最小化的、稳定的**核心系统（Core System）",["$","strong","strong-1",{"children":"和一个由独立"}],"插件组件（Plug-in Components）**构成的可扩展生态。"]}],"\n",["$","p","p-3",{"children":"我们可以将其想象成一个智能手机：操作系统是其微核，提供最基础的功能（通信、电源管理、应用商店接口），而我们安装的每一个 App 就是一个插件，为手机赋予了无穷无尽的新功能。"}],"\n","$L8","\n","$L9","\n","$La","\n","$Lb","\n","$Lc","\n","$Ld","\n","$Le","\n","$Lf","\n","$L10","\n","$L11","\n","$L12","\n","$L13","\n","$L14","\n","$L15","\n","$L16","\n","$L17","\n","$L18","\n","$L19","\n","$L1a","\n","$L1b","\n","$L1c","\n","$L1d","\n","$L1e","\n","$L1f","\n","$L20","\n","$L21","\n","$L22","\n","$L23","\n","$L24","\n","$L25","\n","$L26","\n","$L27","\n","$L28","\n","$L29","\n","$L2a","\n","$L2b","\n","$L2c"]}]}],"$L2d","$L2e","$L2f"]}],"$L30"]}]]}]}]
