8:["$","p","p-4",{"children":"核心构成："}]
9:["$","ul","ul-0",{"children":["\n",["$","li","li-0",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"核心系统 (Core System)"}],"：这是架构的“微核”。它的职责被严格限制在",["$","strong","strong-1",{"children":"最小且必要"}],"的范围内，通常只包含：\n",["$","ol","ol-0",{"children":["\n",["$","li","li-0",{"children":"系统运行所必需的通用业务逻辑（例如，一个 IDE 的文件管理和基础编辑器）。"}],"\n",["$","li","li-1",{"children":["一个至关重要的",["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"插件管理机制"}],"，包括插件的注册、发现、生命周期管理等。这是连接核心与插件的桥梁。"]}],"\n"]}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-1",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"插件组件 (Plug-in Components)"}],"：这些是独立的、可插拔的模块，用于实现",["$","strong","strong-1",{"children":"扩展功能或特定业务逻辑"}],"。每个插件都通过一个由核心系统定义的**标准契约（Standard Contract）**来与核心交互。这个契约通常是一个接口或一组 API。"]}],"\n"]}]
a:["$","p","p-5",{"children":["$","$L31","img-0",{"src":"https://hedonspace.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/img/image-20250716105151041.png","alt":"FOSA Figure 12-1. Basic components of the microkernel architecture style","node":{"type":"element","tagName":"img","properties":{"src":"https://hedonspace.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/img/image-20250716105151041.png","alt":"FOSA Figure 12-1. Basic components of the microkernel architecture style"},"children":[],"position":{"start":{"line":52,"column":1,"offset":1591},"end":{"line":52,"column":156,"offset":1746}}}}]}]
