11:["$","p","p-8",{"children":["允许插件间依赖的",["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"合理情况"}],"是：当一个插件的功能是另一个插件功能的",["$","strong","strong-1",{"children":"逻辑扩展或前提"}],"时。"]}]
12:["$","blockquote","blockquote-1",{"children":["\n",["$","p","p-0",{"children":["例如：一个 ",["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"PDF 导出"}]," 插件，可能需要依赖一个通用的 ",["$","code","code-1",{"className":"$undefined","children":"报表生成"}]," 插件。",["$","code","code-2",{"className":"$undefined","children":"PDF 导出"}]," 插件负责将 ",["$","code","code-3",{"className":"$undefined","children":"报表生成"}]," 插件产生的数据模型渲染成 PDF 文件。"]}],"\n"]}]
13:["$","h3","h3-1",{"id":"插件管理","children":["$","a","a-0",{"href":"#插件管理","node":{"type":"element","tagName":"a","properties":{"href":"#插件管理"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"插件管理","position":{"start":{"line":75,"column":5,"offset":2130},"end":{"line":75,"column":9,"offset":2134}}}]},"children":"插件管理"}]}]
14:["$","blockquote","blockquote-2",{"children":["\n",["$","p","p-0",{"children":"What are some of the tools and frameworks that can be used to manage plug-ins?"}],"\n",["$","p","p-1",{"children":"有哪些工具和框架可用于管理插件？"}],"\n"]}]
15:["$","p","p-9",{"children":"管理插件的复杂性催生了许多优秀的框架和标准："}]
16:["$","ol","ol-1",{"children":["\n",["$","li","li-0",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"OSGi (Open Service Gateway initiative)"}],"：这是 Java 平台中最著名、最强大的插件化框架。它提供了一整套完善的模块层（Bundle）和生命周期管理机制，是构建大型、复杂微核系统的首选。Eclipse IDE 就是基于 OSGi 构建的。"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-1",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"Eclipse Rich Client Platform (RCP)"}],"：基于 OSGi，专门用于构建桌面富客户端应用的框架，其本身就是一个微核。"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-2",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"Java Platform Module System (JPMS)"}],"：从 Java 9 开始引入的官方模块化系统，也可以作为实现插件化的基础。"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-3",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"Java ServiceLoader"}],"：Java 内置的一个简单的服务发现机制，适用于较轻量级的插件化场景。"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-4",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"其他生态"}],"：在 .NET 中有 MEF (Managed Extensibility Framework)；在 Web 应用中，可以通过 Webhooks 机制实现一种分布式的插件化思想，允许第三方服务作为“插件”来响应核心系统的事件。"]}],"\n"]}]
17:["$","h3","h3-2",{"id":"插件适配","children":["$","a","a-0",{"href":"#插件适配","node":{"type":"element","tagName":"a","properties":{"href":"#插件适配"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"插件适配","position":{"start":{"line":89,"column":5,"offset":2757},"end":{"line":89,"column":9,"offset":2761}}}]},"children":"插件适配"}]}]
18:["$","blockquote","blockquote-3",{"children":["\n",["$","p","p-0",{"children":"What would you do if you had a third-party plug-in that didn’t conform to the standard plug-in contract in the core system?"}],"\n",["$","p","p-1",{"children":"如果一个第三方插件不遵循核心系统的标准插件契约，你会怎么做？"}],"\n"]}]
19:["$","p","p-10",{"children":["如果一个第三方插件不遵循核心系统的标准插件契约，最佳解决方案是引入",["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"适配器模式 (Adapter Pattern)"}],"。"]}]
1a:["$","p","p-11",{"children":"具体做法是："}]
1b:["$","ul","ul-2",{"children":["\n",["$","li","li-0",{"children":["\n",["$","p","p-0",{"children":["创建一个新的、我们自己控制的",["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"适配器插件 (Adapter Plug-in)"}],"，这个适配器插件",["$","strong","strong-1",{"children":"遵循"}],"我们核心系统的标准契约。"]}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-1",{"children":["\n",["$","p","p-0",{"children":["在适配器插件的内部，它负责将核心系统发来的请求",["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"翻译"}],"成第三方插件能够理解的格式，并调用第三方插件。"]}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-2",{"children":["\n",["$","p","p-0",{"children":["反之，它也负责将第三方插件的返回结果",["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"翻译"}],"回核心系统期望的格式。"]}],"\n"]}],"\n"]}]
